               shed light on how PPAR$\gamma$ agonists promote adipose tissue
               plasticity in obesity.",
  journal   = "Cell Rep.",
  publisher = "Elsevier BV",
  volume    =  43,
  number    =  12,
  pages     = "114945",
  month     =  dec,
  year      =  2024,
  keywords  = "CP: Metabolism; adipocytes; adipose progenitors; adipose stem
