              Virgin, Herbert W and Listgarten, Jennifer and Root, David E",
  abstract = "CRISPR-Cas9-based genetic screens are a powerful new tool in
              biology. By simply altering the sequence of the single-guide RNA
              (sgRNA), one can reprogram Cas9 to target different sites in the
              genome with relative ease, but the on-target activity and
